new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b6446fc
--- /dev/null
+++ b/stubs/README
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Minimal stand-ins for Google vendor headers used by the AOC driver, written for
+the Pixel 7 Pro port. Each provides only what aoc.c uses, as a safe no-op:
+no coredump provider, no ACPM reset channel, no SICD veto (the kernel does not
+enter SICD), and PMU reads that fail instead of touching hardware.
